post.description:
Import the checked rows; the job moves to completed with a report of rows that failed. Needs every
location (403 all-locations-required) and the keys of the staff commands the type's writes stand for;
409 check-stale when the file changed after the check.

Take a payment and allocate it. 201 whatever the outcome: read `status` (`succeeded`, `processing`
for a bank debit, `failed` for a decline, `unknown` when the processor did not answer). Errors:
allocation-exceeds-balance, allocation-exceeds-payment, processor-not-connected.
